-- Smash history: the sets of 2013's Melee majors, read by hand from Liquipedia's bracket pages (Matthew, 2026-11-22:
-- "Read pages by hand"). Liquipedia keeps the later rounds of these brackets, not every set; scores as it lists
-- them (none where it only marks the winner). Made with tools/liquipedia/bracket-to-sql.mjs from
-- tools/liquipedia/brackets/2013-melee.txt. Safe to run twice.

-- manual/2013-zenith-2013 (melee): 94 sets, from https://liquipedia.net/smash/Zenith/2013/Melee/Singles_Bracket
on conflict (set_id) do update set round = excluded.round, sort_order = excluded.sort_order, p1_name = excluded.p1_name,
  p1_score = excluded.p1_score, p2_name = excluded.p2_name, p2_score = excluded.p2_score, winner = excluded.winner;

